.env*

# Generated by `npm run build`. Vercel runs that build on every deploy, so
# these are never committed -- keeping build output in git is what let the
# site drift from packaging/docs/ and needed a CI job to police it.
# Run `npm run build` locally when you want to preview; the result stays
# out of git by design.
